### 2.7 Error - not enough questions (example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/config
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxOSIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoibHVuYWEiLCJpYXQiOjE3NzE4NjE2NzYsImV4cCI6MTc3MTk0ODA3Nn0.rYiB5Q2ki6OKPwOaUVj15DPQNK0JQCL8lnwDN9HKZMY

{
  "mode": "Q20",
  "categories": [1],
  "difficulties": ["HARD"]
}

### 2.8 Error - forbidden for non-host user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/config
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer <other_user_token>

{
  "mode": "Q5",
  "categories": [1, 2],
  "difficulties": ["EASY"]
}

# ============================================
# 3) GAME START
# ============================================

### 3.1 Success - start game (host token, after players are ready)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/start
Authorization: Bearer <host_token>

### 3.2 Error - unauthorized (missing token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/start

### 3.3 Error - forbidden for non-host
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/start
Authorization: Bearer <other_user_token>

### 3.4 Error - game already running (call start twice)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/start
Authorization: Bearer <host_token>

### 3.5 Error - not all players are ready
# Preconditions:
# 1) Ensure at least one player in session with is_ready = false
# 2) Session state must be LOBBY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/game/start
Authorization: Bearer <host_token>

